  "description": "The once-promising rookie idol group “Sepia” finds itself on the brink of disbandment. In a desperate bid to survive, the members turn to the dark side of the industry. Their manager, who has always cared for them like family, is forced to watch—and even facilitate—as they are pushed into situations he never wanted for them.\n\nA dark story of powerlessness, survival, and the harsh realities behind the idol industry.\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/I_Became_the_Manager_of_a_Sponsored_Idol)",
